  m_text: "You\u2019re about to launch MetaShot. If you\u2019re overly sensitive
    or prone to taking offense, then fuck off and close it.\r\nThere is absolutely
    no respect or nostalgia for the Soviet era here\u2014that will become quite clear
    as you go on\u2014and any Soviet-themed imagery is purely decorative. The game
    features themes of religion, drugs, and violence; it is strictly for an 16+ audience.\r\nAll
    characters, names, and events are entirely fictional. If you proceed, that\u2019s
    on you\u2014don\u2019t come crying to me with complaints.\r\nGood luck not shitting
    yourself."
